"Programs other people shared. Each was checked before it was added, and says what it can do, worked out from its blocks. To share one of yours, see gallery/README.md in the Second Thought folder.":"Programmata ab aliis communicata. Quodque inspectum est antequam additum est, et dicit quid facere possit, ex lateribus suis computatum. Ut unum ex tuis communices, vide gallery/README.md in folliculo Second Thought.",
