"Reusable prompt text. Drop the 'prompt' block (in Ask Claude) into any slot and type the prompt's name.":"Textus praescriptorum iterum utendus. Laterem «praescriptum» (in Interroga Claude) in quamlibet rimam pone et nomen praescripti scribe.",
"Name":"Nomen",
"house style":"stilus domesticus",
"Text":"Textus",
"Save prompt":"Serva praescriptum",
"In this page, the Home Assistant blocks use a <b>sample house</b>, so you can build and test safely. Change a state below (press Enter) to try your 'when … changes' scripts. Exported Python connects to your real Home Assistant: set HA_URL and HA_TOKEN (a long-lived access token from your Home Assistant profile, under Security).":"In hac pagina, lateres Home Assistant <b>domo exemplari</b> utuntur, ut tuto aedificare et experiri possis. Statum infra muta (preme Enter) ut scripta tua «cum … mutatur» experiaris. Python exportatum ad verum Home Assistant tuum conectitur: statue HA_URL et HA_TOKEN (signum accessus diuturnum ex profilo Home Assistant tuo, sub Securitate).",
"Filter entities":"Entitates cola",
"Filter, e.g. light or kitchen":"Cola, e.g. light aut culina",
"Forget all":"Obliviscere omnia",
"Forget everything in memory? This can't be undone.":"Omnia in memoria oblivisci? Hoc revocari non potest.",
"Keep it":"Serva",
"Backup models":"Exemplaria tutelae",
"The <b>Model</b> menu is your primary model: it does every step. If it fails on a step (no key, out of credit, service down or unreachable), the first backup answers that step instead, then the second, then the third. The run log says each time a backup steps in.":"Menu <b>Exemplar</b> est exemplar principale tuum: omnem gradum facit. Si in gradu deficit (nulla clavis, nulla pecunia, ministerium deficiens aut inaccessibile), primum exemplar tutelae pro eo gradu respondet, deinde secundum, deinde tertium. Acta exsecutionis dicunt quotiens exemplar tutelae succedit.",
"Blocks that name their own model, such as <b>with model</b>, keep that model, so a panel of judges stays a panel of different judges.":"Lateres qui suum exemplar nominant, ut <b>cum exemplari</b>, id exemplar servant, ut collegium iudicum maneat collegium diversorum iudicum.",
