"There's no email with id {id}.":"Nulla epistula electronica cum id {id} est.",
"There's no prompt called “{name}” in your prompt library. Open Programs to add it.":"Nullum praescriptum nomine «{name}» in bibliotheca praescriptorum tua est. Aperi Programmata ut id addas.",
"There's no saved program called “{name}”. Save it from the Programs button first.":"Nullum programma servatum nomine «{name}» est. Prius id ex globulo Programmata serva.",
"There's nothing to save: the value in the 'save as file' block is empty.":"Nihil servandum est: valor in latere «serva ut fasciculum» vacuus est.",
"This page can't open other websites, so the agent is told to use search_web instead. Exported Python reads the page for real.":"Haec pagina alios situs interretiales aperire non potest, itaque procuratori dicitur ut search_web potius utatur. Python exportatum paginam vere legit.",
"This page can't open {u}, so it only has its sample feeds: {feeds}. Exported Python reads any feed.":"Haec pagina {u} aperire non potest, itaque solum fluxus exemplares habet: {feeds}. Python exportatum quemlibet fluxum legit.",
"This page uses a sample house, so nothing real is read or switched. Export to Python to use your own Home Assistant.":"Haec pagina domo exemplari utitur, itaque nihil verum legitur aut commutatur. In Python exporta ut tuo Home Assistant utaris.",
"This page uses sample {noun}, so nothing real is read or sent. Exported Python uses your own.":"Haec pagina exempla adhibet ({noun}), itaque nihil verum legitur aut mittitur. Python exportatum tuis utitur.",
"This program only has scheduled scripts. Turn Schedules on to let them run, or add 'when Run is clicked' from Events.":"Hoc programma solum scripta statuta habet. Horaria accende ut currant, aut adde «cum Exsequere premitur» ex Eventibus.",
"This run stops before a Claude call once it has used about {budget} tokens (about {used} so far).":"Haec exsecutio ante vocationem Claude sistitur cum circiter {budget} signa consumpsit (circiter {used} adhuc).",
"This view can't send pictures to Claude, so blocks that look at photos can't run here.":"Hic conspectus imagines ad Claude mittere non potest, itaque lateres qui photographias inspiciunt hic currere non possunt.",
"To change a list, put a list variable in the 'in list' slot.":"Ut indicem mutes, variabilem indicis in rimam «in indice» pone.",
"To save a picture, use the 'save picture' block.":"Ut imaginem serves, latere «serva imaginem» utere.",
"Too many scripts running at once (over {n}). Use 'broadcast and wait' inside loops.":"Nimis multa scripta simul currunt (plus quam {n}). Utere «praedica et exspecta» intra orbes.",
"Tools: {tools}":"Instrumenta: {tools}",
"Try {attempt} of {max} failed: {lastError}\nTrying again in {seconds}s.":"Conatus {attempt} ex {max} defecit: {lastError}\nIterum temptatur post {seconds}s.",
"Unknown tool “{name}”.":"Instrumentum ignotum «{name}».",
"Using {model}":"Utitur {model}",
"Using {model} for the blocks inside":"Utitur {model} pro lateribus intus",
"Waiting for you to confirm the download…":"Exspectatur dum depositionem confirmes…",
"Went back to the draft from round {round}: it had the fewest problems ({n}). The rounds after it didn't improve on it.":"Ad adumbrationem circuitus {round} rediit: paucissima vitia habuit ({n}). Circuitus post eum eam non emendaverunt.",
"Which Homey device? Give its name, like Kitchen light.":"Quis apparatus Homey? Nomen eius da, ut Lux culinae.",
"Why: {why}":"Cur: {why}",
"Woke {n} waiting script.":"{n} scriptum exspectans excitatum.",
"Woke {n} waiting scripts.":"{n} scripta exspectantia excitata.",
"You can't publish to a topic with + or # in it: those only work for listening.":"In argumentum cum + aut # divulgare non potes: illa solum ad auscultandum valent.",
"You said no, so the program skipped this: {said}":"Negavisti, itaque programma hoc praeteriit: {said}",
"all day":"totum diem",
"any smart home action (Home Assistant, Homey or MQTT)":"quamlibet actionem domus callidae (Home Assistant, Homey aut MQTT)",
"ask_me needs a question.":"ask_me quaestione eget.",
"calculate couldn't work out “{expression}”: {message}.":"calculate «{expression}» computare non potuit: {message}.",
