"plans first":"primum consilium capit",
"read_email needs an email's id number, from search_email.":"read_email numero id epistulae eget, ex search_email.",
"read_page needs a web address starting with http:// or https://.":"read_page inscriptione interretiali eget quae incipit ab http:// aut https://.",
"remember needs a name.":"remember nomine eget.",
"review_text needs criteria to check against.":"review_text normis eget secundum quas examinet.",
